{"id":"b6affdb837eb529f","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-beck-comparison-left-adjoint.md","title":"Theorem — 由反身余等化构造比较函子的左伴随","display":"Theorem — 由反身余等化构造比较函子的左伴随","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-beck-comparison-left-adjoint","aliases":["14-thm-beck-comparison-left-adjoint"],"display":"Theorem — 由反身余等化构造比较函子的左伴随","source_ref":"IV.4 Theorem 2(i), printed 179; DjVu 95","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-monadic-adjunction]]","[[14-df-split-coequalizer]]","[[14-thm-free-algebra-coequalizer]]","[[14-thm-adjunction-hom-bijection]]","[[14-df-natural-transformation]]","[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]","[[14-df-identity-composite-functors]]","[[14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-beck-comparison-left-adjoint"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-beck-comparison-left-adjoint</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 由反身余等化构造比较函子的左伴随"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"IV.4 Theorem 2(i), printed 179; DjVu 95"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"552e996c15863488\" href=\"?note=552e996c15863488\" title=\"14-df-monadic-adjunction\">14-df-monadic-adjunction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0f4ff76187675015\" href=\"?note=0f4ff76187675015\" title=\"14-df-split-coequalizer\">14-df-split-coequalizer</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"34c430417768f1a0\" href=\"?note=34c430417768f1a0\" title=\"14-thm-free-algebra-coequalizer\">14-thm-free-algebra-coequalizer</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3c6d89bc622365e0\" href=\"?note=3c6d89bc622365e0\" title=\"14-thm-adjunction-hom-bijection\">14-thm-adjunction-hom-bijection</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1bdaf4a293143165\" href=\"?note=1bdaf4a293143165\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation\">14-df-natural-transformation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d2b4e5cf16585f95\" href=\"?note=d2b4e5cf16585f95\" title=\"14-df-adjoint-functors\">14-df-adjoint-functors</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"dad26c5de724390a\" href=\"?note=dad26c5de724390a\" title=\"14-df-identity-composite-functors\">14-df-identity-composite-functors</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f012515fd4cf0061\" href=\"?note=f012515fd4cf0061\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering\">14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"552e996c15863488\" href=\"?note=552e996c15863488\" title=\"14-df-monadic-adjunction\">14-df-monadic-adjunction</a> 的指定伴随 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:\\mathcal C\\rightleftarrows\\mathcal D:G\">\\(F:\\mathcal C\\rightleftarrows\\mathcal D:G\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta,\\varepsilon,T\">\\(\\eta,\\varepsilon,T\\)</span> 及比较函子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf K\">\\(\\mathsf K\\)</span>。假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathcal D\\)</span> 中每个反身平行对都有余等化子，其精确条件为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall P,Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D)\\ \\forall f,g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(P,Q)\\quad\\operatorname{IsReflexivePair}_{\\mathcal D}(f,g)\\Rightarrow\\exists R\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D)\\ \\exists v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(Q,R)\\ \\operatorname{IsCoeq}_{\\mathcal D}(v,f,g).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall P,Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D)\\ \\forall f,g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(P,Q)\\quad\\operatorname{IsReflexivePair}_{\\mathcal D}(f,g)\\Rightarrow\\exists R\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D)\\ \\exists v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(Q,R)\\ \\operatorname{IsCoeq}_{\\mathcal D}(v,f,g).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_0,q\">\\(L_0,q\\)</span> 为候选选择函数；只在下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BeckFamily}(L_0,q)\">\\(\\operatorname{BeckFamily}(L_0,q)\\)</span> 成立时使用随后构造。对代数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K=(A,a)\">\\(K=(A,a)\\)</span> 写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_K=q(K)\">\\(q_K=q(K)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_K=L_0(K)\">\\(L_K=L_0(K)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta_T\">\\(\\beta_T\\)</span> 取底层箭头。所用的选择公理与宇宙约定见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a>；不预设新函子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 已经存在。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{BeckFamily}(L_0,q)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\nL_0:\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C^T)\\to\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D)\n\\land q:\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C^T)\\to\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal D)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall(A,a)\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C^T)\\\n\\bigl(q_{(A,a)}\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(F(A),L_{(A,a)})\n\\land\\operatorname{IsCoeq}_{\\mathcal D}(q_{(A,a)},\\varepsilon_{F(A)},F(a))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{BeckFamily}(L_0,q)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\nL_0:\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C^T)\\to\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D)\n\\land q:\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C^T)\\to\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal D)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall(A,a)\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C^T)\\\n\\bigl(q_{(A,a)}\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(F(A),L_{(A,a)})\n\\land\\operatorname{IsCoeq}_{\\mathcal D}(q_{(A,a)},\\varepsilon_{F(A)},F(a))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists L_0,q\\ \\operatorname{BeckFamily}(L_0,q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists L_0,q\\ \\operatorname{BeckFamily}(L_0,q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall K,K&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C^T)\\ \\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^T}(K,K&#39;)\\quad\\exists!v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(L_K,L_{K&#39;})\\ (v\\circ q_K=q_{K&#39;}\\circ F(\\beta_T(u))).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall K,K&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C^T)\\ \\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^T}(K,K&#39;)\\quad\\exists!v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(L_K,L_{K&#39;})\\ (v\\circ q_K=q_{K&#39;}\\circ F(\\beta_T(u))).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L_1(u)\\coloneqq\\iota v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(L_K,L_{K&#39;})\\\n(v\\circ q_K=q_{K&#39;}\\circ F(\\beta_T(u)))\n\\quad(u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^T}(K,K&#39;)),\\qquad L\\coloneqq(L_0,L_1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L_1(u)\\coloneqq\\iota v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(L_K,L_{K&#39;})\\\n(v\\circ q_K=q_{K&#39;}\\circ F(\\beta_T(u)))\n\\quad(u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^T}(K,K&#39;)),\\qquad L\\coloneqq(L_0,L_1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(L,\\mathcal C^T,\\mathcal D).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(L,\\mathcal C^T,\\mathcal D).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\Phi_{K,D}(h)\\coloneqq(K,\\mathsf K(D),G(h\\circ q_K)\\circ\\eta_A),\\\\\n\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^T}(K,\\mathsf K(D))\\quad\\exists!h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(L_K,D)\\ (h\\circ q_K=\\varepsilon_D\\circ F(\\beta_T(u))),\\\\\n\\Psi_{K,D}(u)\\coloneqq\\iota h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(L_K,D)\\\n(h\\circ q_K=\\varepsilon_D\\circ F(\\beta_T(u))),\\\\\n\\Phi_{K,D}:\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(L_K,D)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^T}(K,\\mathsf K(D)),\\qquad\n\\Psi_{K,D}=\\Phi_{K,D}^{-1}\\quad(K=(A,a)).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\Phi_{K,D}(h)\\coloneqq(K,\\mathsf K(D),G(h\\circ q_K)\\circ\\eta_A),\\\\\n\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^T}(K,\\mathsf K(D))\\quad\\exists!h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(L_K,D)\\ (h\\circ q_K=\\varepsilon_D\\circ F(\\beta_T(u))),\\\\\n\\Psi_{K,D}(u)\\coloneqq\\iota h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(L_K,D)\\\n(h\\circ q_K=\\varepsilon_D\\circ F(\\beta_T(u))),\\\\\n\\Phi_{K,D}:\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(L_K,D)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^T}(K,\\mathsf K(D)),\\qquad\n\\Psi_{K,D}=\\Phi_{K,D}^{-1}\\quad(K=(A,a)).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_{K&#39;,D&#39;}(y\\circ h\\circ L(x))\n=\\mathsf K(y)\\circ\\Phi_{K,D}(h)\\circ x\n\\quad\\left(\n\\begin{gathered}\nx\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^T}(K&#39;,K),\\\ny\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(D,D&#39;),\\\nh\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(L_K,D)\n\\end{gathered}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi_{K&#39;,D&#39;}(y\\circ h\\circ L(x))\n=\\mathsf K(y)\\circ\\Phi_{K,D}(h)\\circ x\n\\quad\\left(\n\\begin{gathered}\nx\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^T}(K&#39;,K),\\\ny\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(D,D&#39;),\\\nh\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(L_K,D)\n\\end{gathered}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\lambda_K\\coloneqq(K,\\mathsf K(L_K),G(q_K)\\circ\\eta_A)\\quad(K=(A,a)),\\\\\n\\exists!v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(L_{\\mathsf K(D)},D)\\quad v\\circ q_{\\mathsf K(D)}=\\varepsilon_D,\\\\\n\\kappa_D\\coloneqq\\iota v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(L_{\\mathsf K(D)},D)\\\n(v\\circ q_{\\mathsf K(D)}=\\varepsilon_D),\\\\\n\\lambda\\coloneqq(1_{\\mathcal C^T},\\mathsf K\\circ L,(\\lambda_K)_{K\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C^T)}),\\qquad\n\\kappa\\coloneqq(L\\circ\\mathsf K,1_{\\mathcal D},(\\kappa_D)_{D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D)}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{IsNatural}(\\lambda,1_{\\mathcal C^T},\\mathsf K\\circ L),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{IsNatural}(\\kappa,L\\circ\\mathsf K,1_{\\mathcal D}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{IsAdjunction}(L,\\mathsf K),\\\\\n\\mathsf K(\\kappa_D)\\circ\\lambda_{\\mathsf K(D)}\n=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal C^T}(\\mathsf K(D)),\\qquad\n\\kappa_{L_K}\\circ L(\\lambda_K)=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal D}(L_K).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\lambda_K\\coloneqq(K,\\mathsf K(L_K),G(q_K)\\circ\\eta_A)\\quad(K=(A,a)),\\\\\n\\exists!v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(L_{\\mathsf K(D)},D)\\quad v\\circ q_{\\mathsf K(D)}=\\varepsilon_D,\\\\\n\\kappa_D\\coloneqq\\iota v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(L_{\\mathsf K(D)},D)\\\n(v\\circ q_{\\mathsf K(D)}=\\varepsilon_D),\\\\\n\\lambda\\coloneqq(1_{\\mathcal C^T},\\mathsf K\\circ L,(\\lambda_K)_{K\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C^T)}),\\qquad\n\\kappa\\coloneqq(L\\circ\\mathsf K,1_{\\mathcal D},(\\kappa_D)_{D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D)}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{IsNatural}(\\lambda,1_{\\mathcal C^T},\\mathsf K\\circ L),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{IsNatural}(\\kappa,L\\circ\\mathsf K,1_{\\mathcal D}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{IsAdjunction}(L,\\mathsf K),\\\\\n\\mathsf K(\\kappa_D)\\circ\\lambda_{\\mathsf K(D)}\n=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal C^T}(\\mathsf K(D)),\\qquad\n\\kappa_{L_K}\\circ L(\\lambda_K)=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal D}(L_K).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 IV.4 Theorem2(i)，印刷179（DjVu95），只给构造提纲；这里展开函子作用、Hom双射和其良定义性。所有定义在所声明BeckFamily分支中解释。</p>\n<p>首先，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_{FA},F(a):FTA\\rightrightarrows FA\">\\(\\varepsilon_{FA},F(a):FTA\\rightrightarrows FA\\)</span> 以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(\\eta_A)\">\\(F(\\eta_A)\\)</span> 为共同截面：第一复合是伴随三角式，第二是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(a\\eta_A)=1\">\\(F(a\\eta_A)=1\\)</span>。因此每个代数的余等化存在。对象集合在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 中，选择公理给出一组选择函数，得到BeckFamily。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:K\\to K&#39;\">\\(u:K\\to K&#39;\\)</span> 的底层为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:A\\to A&#39;\">\\(v:A\\to A&#39;\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"va=a&#39;Tv\">\\(va=a&#39;Tv\\)</span>。利用该式、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_{K&#39;}F(a&#39;)=q_{K&#39;}\\varepsilon_{FA&#39;}\">\\(q_{K&#39;}F(a&#39;)=q_{K&#39;}\\varepsilon_{FA&#39;}\\)</span> 及余单位对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Fv\">\\(Fv\\)</span> 的自然性，可得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_{K&#39;}F(v)\">\\(q_{K&#39;}F(v)\\)</span> 余等化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(a),\\varepsilon_{FA}\">\\(F(a),\\varepsilon_{FA}\\)</span>；故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_1(u)\">\\(L_1(u)\\)</span> 存在唯一。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_1(1)q=q\">\\(L_1(1)q=q\\)</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_1(u&#39;u)q=q&#39;&#39;F(v&#39;v)=L_1(u&#39;)L_1(u)q\">\\(L_1(u&#39;u)q=q&#39;&#39;F(v&#39;v)=L_1(u&#39;)L_1(u)q\\)</span>，唯一性给出函子律。</p>\n<p>核心是把余等化条件通过原伴随搬运。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w:FA\\to D\">\\(w:FA\\to D\\)</span>，其转置为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z=Gw\\eta_A\">\\(z=Gw\\eta_A\\)</span>，逆转置为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w=\\varepsilon_DFz\">\\(w=\\varepsilon_DFz\\)</span>。两个箭头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\varepsilon_{FA}\">\\(w\\varepsilon_{FA}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"wF(a)\">\\(wF(a)\\)</span> 的转置（源为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"TA\">\\(TA\\)</span>）分别是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Gw\">\\(Gw\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"za\">\\(za\\)</span>：前者用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_A\\eta_{TA}=1\">\\(\\mu_A\\eta_{TA}=1\\)</span>，后者用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(a)\\eta_{TA}=\\eta_Aa\">\\(T(a)\\eta_{TA}=\\eta_Aa\\)</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Gw=G\\varepsilon_D\\,Tz\">\\(Gw=G\\varepsilon_D\\,Tz\\)</span>。所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 余等化该对，当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"za=G\\varepsilon_D\\,Tz\">\\(za=G\\varepsilon_D\\,Tz\\)</span>，恰是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z:(A,a)\\to\\mathsf K D\">\\(z:(A,a)\\to\\mathsf K D\\)</span> 的代数态射条件。这同时证明两个给定映射有正确值域、逆向因子存在唯一，以及它们互逆。</p>\n<p>对后合成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>，转置的自然性立即给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf K(y)\">\\(\\mathsf K(y)\\)</span>；对前合成代数箭头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，利用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(x)q_{K&#39;}=q_KF(\\beta_Tx)\">\\(L(x)q_{K&#39;}=q_KF(\\beta_Tx)\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span> 自然性，得到所列双变量自然式。令Hom双射作用于恒等箭头，单位即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda_K\">\\(\\lambda_K\\)</span>；逆向作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf K D\">\\(\\mathsf K D\\)</span> 的恒等箭头，余单位即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_D\">\\(\\kappa_D\\)</span>，其因子方程为所列方程。Hom双射互逆与自然性给两条三角式，故<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"d2b4e5cf16585f95\" href=\"?note=d2b4e5cf16585f95\" title=\"14-df-adjoint-functors\">14-df-adjoint-functors</a>的伴随成立。此处只构造 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\dashv\\mathsf K\">\\(L\\dashv\\mathsf K\\)</span>，未预设它是等价。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-monadic-adjunction","status":"resolved","id":"552e996c15863488","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-monadic-adjunction]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-split-coequalizer","status":"resolved","id":"0f4ff76187675015","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-split-coequalizer]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-free-algebra-coequalizer","status":"resolved","id":"34c430417768f1a0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-free-algebra-coequalizer]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-adjunction-hom-bijection","status":"resolved","id":"3c6d89bc622365e0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-adjunction-hom-bijection]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-transformation","status":"resolved","id":"1bdaf4a293143165","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-transformation]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"d2b4e5cf16585f95","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-identity-composite-functors","status":"resolved","id":"dad26c5de724390a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-identity-composite-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering","status":"resolved","id":"f012515fd4cf0061","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-monadic-adjunction","status":"resolved","id":"552e996c15863488","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[14-df-monadic-adjunction]] 的指定伴随 $F:\\mathcal C\\rightleftarrows\\mathcal D:G$、$\\eta,\\varepsilon,T$ 及比较函子 $\\mathsf K$。假设 $\\mathcal D$ 中每个反身平行对都有余等化子，其精确条件为：","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L_0,q$ 为候选选择函数；只在下式 $\\operatorname{BeckFamily}(L_0,q)$ 成立时使用随后构造。对代数 $K=(A,a)$ 写 $q_K=q(K)$、$L_K=L_0(K)$。$\\beta_T$ 取底层箭头。所用的选择公理与宇宙约定见[[14-df-category]]；不预设新函子 $L$ 已经存在。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"d2b4e5cf16585f95","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"对后合成 $y$，转置的自然性立即给 $\\mathsf K(y)$；对前合成代数箭头 $x$，利用 $L(x)q_{K'}=q_KF(\\beta_Tx)$ 及 $\\eta$ 自然性，得到所列双变量自然式。令Hom双射作用于恒等箭头，单位即 $\\lambda_K$；逆向作用于 $\\mathsf K D$ 的恒等箭头，余单位即 $\\kappa_D$，其因子方程为所列方程。Hom双射互逆与自然性给两条三角式，故[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]的伴随成立。此处只构造 $L\\dashv\\mathsf K$，未预设它是等价。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"F:\\mathcal C\\rightleftarrows\\mathcal D:G","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta,\\varepsilon,T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall P,Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D)\\ \\forall f,g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(P,Q)\\quad\\operatorname{IsReflexivePair}_{\\mathcal D}(f,g)\\Rightarrow\\exists R\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D)\\ \\exists v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(Q,R)\\ \\operatorname{IsCoeq}_{\\mathcal D}(v,f,g).","display":true},{"tex":"L_0,q","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BeckFamily}(L_0,q)","display":false},{"tex":"K=(A,a)","display":false},{"tex":"q_K=q(K)","display":false},{"tex":"L_K=L_0(K)","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta_T","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{BeckFamily}(L_0,q)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\nL_0:\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C^T)\\to\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D)\n\\land q:\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C^T)\\to\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal D)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall(A,a)\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C^T)\\\n\\bigl(q_{(A,a)}\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(F(A),L_{(A,a)})\n\\land\\operatorname{IsCoeq}_{\\mathcal D}(q_{(A,a)},\\varepsilon_{F(A)},F(a))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists L_0,q\\ \\operatorname{BeckFamily}(L_0,q).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall K,K'\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C^T)\\ \\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^T}(K,K')\\quad\\exists!v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(L_K,L_{K'})\\ (v\\circ q_K=q_{K'}\\circ F(\\beta_T(u))).","display":true},{"tex":"L_1(u)\\coloneqq\\iota v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(L_K,L_{K'})\\\n(v\\circ q_K=q_{K'}\\circ F(\\beta_T(u)))\n\\quad(u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^T}(K,K')),\\qquad L\\coloneqq(L_0,L_1).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(L,\\mathcal C^T,\\mathcal D).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\Phi_{K,D}(h)\\coloneqq(K,\\mathsf K(D),G(h\\circ q_K)\\circ\\eta_A),\\\\\n\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^T}(K,\\mathsf K(D))\\quad\\exists!h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(L_K,D)\\ (h\\circ q_K=\\varepsilon_D\\circ F(\\beta_T(u))),\\\\\n\\Psi_{K,D}(u)\\coloneqq\\iota h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(L_K,D)\\\n(h\\circ q_K=\\varepsilon_D\\circ F(\\beta_T(u))),\\\\\n\\Phi_{K,D}:\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(L_K,D)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^T}(K,\\mathsf K(D)),\\qquad\n\\Psi_{K,D}=\\Phi_{K,D}^{-1}\\quad(K=(A,a)).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Phi_{K',D'}(y\\circ h\\circ L(x))\n=\\mathsf K(y)\\circ\\Phi_{K,D}(h)\\circ x\n\\quad\\left(\n\\begin{gathered}\nx\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^T}(K',K),\\\ny\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(D,D'),\\\nh\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(L_K,D)\n\\end{gathered}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\lambda_K\\coloneqq(K,\\mathsf K(L_K),G(q_K)\\circ\\eta_A)\\quad(K=(A,a)),\\\\\n\\exists!v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(L_{\\mathsf K(D)},D)\\quad v\\circ q_{\\mathsf K(D)}=\\varepsilon_D,\\\\\n\\kappa_D\\coloneqq\\iota v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(L_{\\mathsf K(D)},D)\\\n(v\\circ q_{\\mathsf K(D)}=\\varepsilon_D),\\\\\n\\lambda\\coloneqq(1_{\\mathcal C^T},\\mathsf K\\circ L,(\\lambda_K)_{K\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C^T)}),\\qquad\n\\kappa\\coloneqq(L\\circ\\mathsf K,1_{\\mathcal D},(\\kappa_D)_{D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D)}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{IsNatural}(\\lambda,1_{\\mathcal C^T},\\mathsf K\\circ L),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{IsNatural}(\\kappa,L\\circ\\mathsf K,1_{\\mathcal D}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{IsAdjunction}(L,\\mathsf K),\\\\\n\\mathsf K(\\kappa_D)\\circ\\lambda_{\\mathsf K(D)}\n=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal C^T}(\\mathsf K(D)),\\qquad\n\\kappa_{L_K}\\circ L(\\lambda_K)=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal D}(L_K).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\varepsilon_{FA},F(a):FTA\\rightrightarrows FA","display":false},{"tex":"F(\\eta_A)","display":false},{"tex":"F(a\\eta_A)=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"u:K\\to K'","display":false},{"tex":"v:A\\to A'","display":false},{"tex":"va=a'Tv","display":false},{"tex":"q_{K'}F(a')=q_{K'}\\varepsilon_{FA'}","display":false},{"tex":"Fv","display":false},{"tex":"q_{K'}F(v)","display":false},{"tex":"F(a),\\varepsilon_{FA}","display":false},{"tex":"L_1(u)","display":false},{"tex":"L_1(1)q=q","display":false},{"tex":"L_1(u'u)q=q''F(v'v)=L_1(u')L_1(u)q","display":false},{"tex":"w:FA\\to D","display":false},{"tex":"z=Gw\\eta_A","display":false},{"tex":"w=\\varepsilon_DFz","display":false},{"tex":"w\\varepsilon_{FA}","display":false},{"tex":"wF(a)","display":false},{"tex":"TA","display":false},{"tex":"Gw","display":false},{"tex":"za","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu_A\\eta_{TA}=1","display":false},{"tex":"T(a)\\eta_{TA}=\\eta_Aa","display":false},{"tex":"Gw=G\\varepsilon_D\\,Tz","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"za=G\\varepsilon_D\\,Tz","display":false},{"tex":"z:(A,a)\\to\\mathsf K D","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf K(y)","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"L(x)q_{K'}=q_KF(\\beta_Tx)","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda_K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf K D","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa_D","display":false},{"tex":"L\\dashv\\mathsf K","display":false}],"bytes":6293,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-317","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-beck-comparison-left-adjoint|Theorem — 由反身余等化构造比较函子的左伴随]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-140","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-beck-comparison-left-adjoint]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-297","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-beck-comparison-left-adjoint]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-219","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-beck-comparison-left-adjoint]]"},{"id":"a847472bc37dd64a","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-beck-comparison-left-adjoint]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-318","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-beck-comparison-left-adjoint|Theorem — 由反身余等化构造比较函子的左伴随]]"},{"id":"f1b3afad9b25fc1d","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":7,"excerpt":"采用[[14-thm-beck-comparison-left-adjoint]]的全部伴随、单子、比较函子与BeckFamily选择，尤其 $\\mathcal D$ 的所有反身平行对余等化均存在；$L,\\lambda,\\kappa$ 是[[14-thm-beck-comparison-left-adjoint]]实际构造的函子、单位和余单位。再假设右伴随 $G$ 保持这些余等化子，并反映同构，其精确条件如下。这里是原书强充分条件，不声称必要条件或任意形式Beck定理。"},{"id":"4f584a450845e8d6","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本轮已将此路线使用的自由/遗忘伴随、比较函子、分裂余等化子和强 Beck 充分判据展开为 [[14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction]]、[[14-df-monadic-adjunction]]、[[14-df-split-coequalizer]]、[[14-thm-free-algebra-coequalizer]]、[[14-thm-beck-comparison-left-adjoint]]、[[14-thm-beck-monadicity]]。它们为该证明提供具体的单子工具；本条仍未展开 IV.5 幂对象反变函子的单子性与其所需余等化保持验证，不能仅凭新增的一般判据就宣称这条有限余极限证明已经完整重建。此段为证明路线导航，Assertion与直接定义依赖未变。"}],"outgoing":["552e996c15863488","0f4ff76187675015","34c430417768f1a0","3c6d89bc622365e0","1bdaf4a293143165","d2b4e5cf16585f95","dad26c5de724390a","f012515fd4cf0061","28211adc1b0ce5bc"]}